Subject: dt-bindings: arm: document the STB core release and the boards

The Hi3798MV100 and the Hi3716CV200 release their secondary cores
through the core CRG, so their CPU nodes name that method rather than
PSCI or a spin-table.
The shape is the same on both parts: the machine code drops the core
resets and pulses the begin bit.
Document the two enable-methods and the boards that use them.

Signed-off-by: David Yang <mmyangfl@gmail.com>
